# MOVEMENT III — MENUETTO. Allegro molto (one in a bar), 3/4, G minor.
# Scherzo ||: b1-16 :||: b17-44 :||  (Fine at b44 after the D.C.)
# Theme = the CELL in crotchets: g g bb | a g f# | g - d | g bb d ...
# b1-4 strings+fg bare octaves f; b5-8 tutti, half close on D;
# b9-12 ob1 (+fl1 8va) answers in Bb, p; b13-16 hemiola cadence in Bb.
# b17-20 theme in the bass (Eb), b21-24 in vn1 (C minor), b25-26
# hemiola Cm - Ger6 - D, b27-28 p on the dominant; b29-34 theme ff
# tutti, b35-38 hemiola cadence in G minor, b39-44 tag.
# Horns back in G (hn12) and Bb basso (hn34); tp in G; timp g2/d3.

== b1-8 [A] ==
@ T=80d.h M=3/4 K=gm "Menuetto. Allegro molto" hn12=G hn34=Bb timp=g2,d3 repeat=b1-16
vn1:  | 4 {f} g4' g4' bb4' | 4 a4' g4' f#4' | 4 g4^ r d4' | 4 g4' bb4' d5' | 4 {ff} g5' g5' bb5' | 4 a5' g5' f#5' | 4 g5^ d5' bb4' | 2 a4^ 4 r |
vn2:  =vn1 @b1-4
vn2:  | R*4 | 4 {ff} r (bb3 g4)> (bb3 g4)> | 4 r (a3 f#4)> (a3 f#4)> | 4 r (bb3 g4)> (bb3 g4)> | 2 (a3 f#4)^ 4 r |
va:   =vn1 -8 @b1-4
va:   | R*4 | 4 {ff} r d4> d4> | 4 r d4> d4> | 4 r d4> d4> | 2 d4^ 4 r |
vc:   =vn1 -16 @b1-4
vc:   | R*4 | 4 {ff} g2^ r r | 4 d2^ r r | 4 g2^ r r | 2 d2^ 4 r |
cb:   =vn1 -24 @b1-4
