@ "Fine" (after D.C.)

HANDOFF:
  next_bar: 45 TRIO   key: G MAJOR   3/4   T=80d.h (same tempo)
  At the seam: b44 tutti ff G-minor stroke on beat 1 (open-fifth bass
  g, horns/tp g), beats 2-3 silent; repeat sign :|| (b17-44); Fine here
  on the D.C.
  NEXT: Trio ||: b45-60 :||: b61-80 :|| — p, Ländler: cl1 + fg1 two
  octaves apart sing the CELL-MAJOR trio theme (g g b | a g f# | g - d |
  b), hn12 G drones (g3 d4), vc/cb pizz CELL-major bass on beats,
  vn2/va soft after-beats; b61 second part to D and Em, horn call,
  return; D.C. al Fine.
